mapping "V6292.1" source="V6292" target="274913009" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target effect=omitted quality=60 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V6292 = Swedish 7th-character extension of ICD-10 V62.9 SNOMED CT 274913009 36198007 with
        suffix (work activity). Base V62.9 (Athena concept 45756678) has Athena Maps-to edges to SNOMED CT
        433930 (274913009) and 444074 (36198007). The Swedish activity axis (work/sport/leisure/etc.)
        has no SNOMED CT representation; it is contextual metadata, not a clinical component. Both targets
        fully contain the accident-event semantics of the source but drop the activity context, so
        broader. 433930 is the specific on-road collision mechanism (moderate: Athena crosswalk to the
        base code, Swedish extension not independently re-verified); 444074 is the more general victim
        concept (low: considerably broader ancestor).
        """
}
